OL,3,ATrump announces 'Super Intelligence
OL,4,AForce' to oversee AI policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he has
OL,7,Fcreated a new task force focused on
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence, which will be
OL,9,Fled by Director of National
OL,10,FIntelligence Jay Clayton.
OL,12,FThe "Super Intelligence Force" will
OL,13,Fwork to ensure that the US continues to
OL,14,Flead in the technology's development
OL,15,Fand will coordinate the government's
OL,16,Fengagement with the public, Trump said
OL,17,Fon social media.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
