OL,3,ABritish Museum announces changes to
OL,4,Aease Bayeux Tapestry queues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Museum has announced
OL,7,Fchanges to how visitors see the Bayeux
OL,8,FTapestry exhibition after concerns over
OL,9,Flong queues and overcrowding.
OL,11,FThe measures include plans for longer
OL,12,Fopening hours, as well as an audio
OL,13,Fguide, additional seating and clearer
OL,14,Fsignage.
OL,16,FA museum spokesperson said the public
OL,17,Fresponse to the 11th Century embroidery
OL,18,Fhad been "extraordinary", but
OL,19,Facknowledged that some visitors had
OL,20,Fwaited longer than they would have
OL,21,Fwanted.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
